  "description": "Retrospective full planning application for the change of use of 82 Bolton Crescent from A1/B2 (retail and coffee roasting/bakery) to Class E(b) (restaurant/café) to allow the preparation and consumption of food and drink on-site, including the sale of cocktails and mocktails (alcohol).\n\nThe proposal includes internal alterations to support food and drink preparation and dining areas, along with external works comprising the retrospective installation of new metal doors painted mint green, installation of illuminated gold-lettered signage to the shopfront, and roof repairs using matching asphalt/felt materials to address leaks.\n\nThe proposal also seeks to regularise the extended opening hours beyond those previously permitted under planning permission ref: 13/05020/FUL, to align with future operations as a sit-in restaurant/café.",
